{"id":"da0bcf2e3f060472","group":"58","path":"58/batch07/58-df-recursive.md","title":"Recursive Function $\\mathrm{Rec}$","display":"df-recursive — Recursive Function $\\mathrm{Rec}$","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-recursive","aliases":["58-df-recursive"],"display":"df-recursive — Recursive Function $\\mathrm{Rec}$","depends_on":["[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-omega.md]]","[[../batch01/58-df-primitive-recursive.md]]","[[../batch01/58-df-composition-operator.md]]","[[../batch02/58-df-primrec-operator.md]]","[[../batch02/58-df-min-operator.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-zero-function.md]]","[[../batch15/58-df-successor-function.md]]","[[../batch11/58-df-projection-function.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-closure-operator.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-partial-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-recursive"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-recursive</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-recursive — Recursive Function <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rec}\">\\(\\mathrm{Rec}\\)</span>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5045d216c83e75cb\" href=\"?note=5045d216c83e75cb\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-omega.md\">../batch16/58-df-omega.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"1cf46a0ea13ab5dd\" href=\"?note=1cf46a0ea13ab5dd\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-primitive-recursive.md\">../batch01/58-df-primitive-recursive.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a2ef5ac555fe2963\" href=\"?note=a2ef5ac555fe2963\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-composition-operator.md\">../batch01/58-df-composition-operator.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"886d3e2a93a3e218\" href=\"?note=886d3e2a93a3e218\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-primrec-operator.md\">../batch02/58-df-primrec-operator.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"457d2f1becb8a815\" href=\"?note=457d2f1becb8a815\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-min-operator.md\">../batch02/58-df-min-operator.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"fff5dc780f29d486\" href=\"?note=fff5dc780f29d486\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-zero-function.md\">../batch13/58-df-zero-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"e8997cda0865ef9b\" href=\"?note=e8997cda0865ef9b\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-successor-function.md\">../batch15/58-df-successor-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"8a304812dec1e29f\" href=\"?note=8a304812dec1e29f\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-projection-function.md\">../batch11/58-df-projection-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"1507ded5fe871bd8\" href=\"?note=1507ded5fe871bd8\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-closure-operator.md\">../batch17/58-df-closure-operator.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"3dd0e6836d447ca6\" href=\"?note=3dd0e6836d447ca6\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-partial-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-partial-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n,m,k\\in\\omega\">\\(n,m,k\\in\\omega\\)</span>；函数以集合图表示，多元函数的输入为有限序列。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PartialFunction}\">\\(\\mathrm{PartialFunction}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PrimitiveRecursive}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{PrimitiveRecursive}_S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PRClosed}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{PRClosed}_S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PartialMinimization}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{PartialMinimization}_S\\)</span> 使用内部依赖。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{UnaryGraph}_{58}(f)=\\{\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in\\omega\\times\\omega:\\langle\\langle x\\rangle,y\\rangle\\in f\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{UnaryGraph}_{58}(f)=\\{\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in\\omega\\times\\omega:\\langle\\langle x\\rangle,y\\rangle\\in f\\}\\)</span>；此式明确区分自然数与一元元组。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Base},\\mathrm{PR},\\mathrm{pRec},\\mathrm{Rec}\">\\(\\mathrm{Base},\\mathrm{PR},\\mathrm{pRec},\\mathrm{Rec}\\)</span> 保留原名称；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PRecClosed}_{58}\">\\(\\mathrm{PRecClosed}_{58}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PartialPrimitiveRecursion}_{58}\">\\(\\mathrm{PartialPrimitiveRecursion}_{58}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SeqPRec}_{58}\">\\(\\mathrm{SeqPRec}_{58}\\)</span> 为下式辅助定义。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Base}\\coloneqq\\{Z,S\\}\\cup\\{\\pi_i^n:n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land i\\in n\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Base}\\coloneqq\\{Z,S\\}\\cup\\{\\pi_i^n:n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land i\\in n\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PR}\\coloneqq\n\\{f\\in\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}\\omega^{\\omega^n}:\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\mathrm{PrimitiveRecursive}_S(f,n)\\}\n\\cup\\{\\mathrm{UnaryGraph}_{58}(f):f\\in\\omega^{\\omega^1}\\land\\mathrm{PrimitiveRecursive}_S(f,1)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{PR}\\coloneqq\n\\{f\\in\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}\\omega^{\\omega^n}:\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\mathrm{PrimitiveRecursive}_S(f,n)\\}\n\\cup\\{\\mathrm{UnaryGraph}_{58}(f):f\\in\\omega^{\\omega^1}\\land\\mathrm{PrimitiveRecursive}_S(f,1)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{PartialPrimitiveRecursion}_{58}(f,g,h,n)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nn\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land\\mathrm{PartialFunction}(g,\\omega^{n-1},\\omega)\n\\land\\mathrm{PartialFunction}(h,\\omega^{n+1},\\omega)\\\\\n&amp;\\land f=\\left\\{\\langle\\vec x^\\frown\\langle t\\rangle,y\\rangle:\\vec x\\in\\omega^{n-1}\\land t,y\\in\\omega\\land\n\\exists s\\in\\omega^{t+1}\\;\\left(\\langle\\vec x,s(0)\\rangle\\in g\\land s(t)=y\\land\n\\forall j\\in t\\;\\langle\\vec x^\\frown\\langle j,s(j)\\rangle,s(j+1)\\rangle\\in h\\right)\\right\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{PartialPrimitiveRecursion}_{58}(f,g,h,n)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nn\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land\\mathrm{PartialFunction}(g,\\omega^{n-1},\\omega)\n\\land\\mathrm{PartialFunction}(h,\\omega^{n+1},\\omega)\\\\\n&amp;\\land f=\\left\\{\\langle\\vec x^\\frown\\langle t\\rangle,y\\rangle:\\vec x\\in\\omega^{n-1}\\land t,y\\in\\omega\\land\n\\exists s\\in\\omega^{t+1}\\;\\left(\\langle\\vec x,s(0)\\rangle\\in g\\land s(t)=y\\land\n\\forall j\\in t\\;\\langle\\vec x^\\frown\\langle j,s(j)\\rangle,s(j+1)\\rangle\\in h\\right)\\right\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{PRecClosed}_{58}(C)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nC\\subseteq\\{f\\in\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}\\mathcal P(\\omega^n\\times\\omega):\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\mathrm{PartialFunction}(f,\\omega^n,\\omega)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall f\\in\\omega^{\\omega^n}\\;(\\mathrm{PrimitiveRecursive}_S(f,n)\\to f\\in C)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall n,m\\in\\omega\\;\\forall h\\in C\\;\\forall\\vec g\\in C^m\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{PartialFunction}(h,\\omega^m,\\omega)\\land\\forall i\\in m\\;\\mathrm{PartialFunction}(\\vec g(i),\\omega^n,\\omega)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\to\\{\\langle\\vec x,y\\rangle\\in\\omega^n\\times\\omega:\\exists\\vec z\\in\\omega^m\\;\n(\\forall i\\in m\\;\\langle\\vec x,\\vec z(i)\\rangle\\in\\vec g(i))\\land\\langle\\vec z,y\\rangle\\in h\\}\\in C\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\forall g,h\\in C\\;\\forall f\\in V\\;\n(\\mathrm{PartialPrimitiveRecursion}_{58}(f,g,h,n)\\to f\\in C)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall k\\in\\omega\\;\\forall g\\in C\\;\\forall f\\in V\\;\n(\\mathrm{PartialMinimization}_S(f,g,k)\\to f\\in C).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{PRecClosed}_{58}(C)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nC\\subseteq\\{f\\in\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}\\mathcal P(\\omega^n\\times\\omega):\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\mathrm{PartialFunction}(f,\\omega^n,\\omega)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall f\\in\\omega^{\\omega^n}\\;(\\mathrm{PrimitiveRecursive}_S(f,n)\\to f\\in C)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall n,m\\in\\omega\\;\\forall h\\in C\\;\\forall\\vec g\\in C^m\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{PartialFunction}(h,\\omega^m,\\omega)\\land\\forall i\\in m\\;\\mathrm{PartialFunction}(\\vec g(i),\\omega^n,\\omega)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\to\\{\\langle\\vec x,y\\rangle\\in\\omega^n\\times\\omega:\\exists\\vec z\\in\\omega^m\\;\n(\\forall i\\in m\\;\\langle\\vec x,\\vec z(i)\\rangle\\in\\vec g(i))\\land\\langle\\vec z,y\\rangle\\in h\\}\\in C\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\forall g,h\\in C\\;\\forall f\\in V\\;\n(\\mathrm{PartialPrimitiveRecursion}_{58}(f,g,h,n)\\to f\\in C)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall k\\in\\omega\\;\\forall g\\in C\\;\\forall f\\in V\\;\n(\\mathrm{PartialMinimization}_S(f,g,k)\\to f\\in C).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SeqPRec}_{58}\\coloneqq\n\\bigcap\\{C\\subseteq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}\\mathcal P(\\omega^n\\times\\omega):\\mathrm{PRecClosed}_{58}(C)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{SeqPRec}_{58}\\coloneqq\n\\bigcap\\{C\\subseteq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}\\mathcal P(\\omega^n\\times\\omega):\\mathrm{PRecClosed}_{58}(C)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{pRec}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{SeqPRec}_{58}\\cup\n\\{\\mathrm{UnaryGraph}_{58}(f):f\\in\\mathrm{SeqPRec}_{58}\\land\\mathrm{PartialFunction}(f,\\omega^1,\\omega)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{pRec}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{SeqPRec}_{58}\\cup\n\\{\\mathrm{UnaryGraph}_{58}(f):f\\in\\mathrm{SeqPRec}_{58}\\land\\mathrm{PartialFunction}(f,\\omega^1,\\omega)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rec}\\coloneqq\n\\{f\\in\\mathrm{pRec}:\\mathrm{Function}(f,\\omega,\\omega)\\lor\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\mathrm{Function}(f,\\omega^n,\\omega)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Rec}\\coloneqq\n\\{f\\in\\mathrm{pRec}:\\mathrm{Function}(f,\\omega,\\omega)\\lor\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\mathrm{Function}(f,\\omega^n,\\omega)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>仍定义零函数、后继、投影在复合、原始递归、最小化下生成的部分递归函数及其全函数部分。</li>\n<li>闭包条件中的输出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> 在全集中量化，不再预先假设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in C\">\\(f\\in C\\)</span> 而使闭包条件成为重言式；最小化使用部分输入的精确收敛语义。</li>\n<li>同时保留多元元组图与一元自然数图两种原有调用方式，二者之间的转换在 Hypothesis 中给出；依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rec}\\cap\\omega^\\omega\">\\(\\mathrm{Rec}\\cap\\omega^\\omega\\)</span> 的枚举定义因而具有实际含义。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Related-Concepts\">[Related Concepts]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"1cf46a0ea13ab5dd\" href=\"?note=1cf46a0ea13ab5dd\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-primitive-recursive.md\">../batch01/58-df-primitive-recursive.md</a> — 原始递归函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PR}\">\\(\\mathrm{PR}\\)</span></li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"af73296236e5df83\" href=\"?note=af73296236e5df83\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-turing-machine.md\">../batch05/58-df-turing-machine.md</a> — Turing 机</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"457d2f1becb8a815\" href=\"?note=457d2f1becb8a815\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-min-operator.md\">../batch02/58-df-min-operator.md</a> — 最小化算子</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Related-Concepts","text":"[Related Concepts]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-omega.md","status":"resolved","id":"5045d216c83e75cb","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-omega.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/58-df-primitive-recursive.md","status":"resolved","id":"1cf46a0ea13ab5dd","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-primitive-recursive.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/5